{"id": "housing-loans-not-expected-back", "title": "Nine-tenths of the City’s housing and small-business loans are not expected to be repaid", "seconds": 119.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "4bceb3adc89796e9", "words": 330, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "San Francisco’s Board approves money for affordable housing as loans.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.58, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "approves affordable-housing money as loans"}, "emph": ["loans"], "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.94, 1.28, 1.78, 2.1, 2.29, 2.75, 3.11, 3.26]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "So how much does the City expect back?", "t0": 4.58, "t1": 7.38, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "approves affordable-housing money as loans"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.41, 0.63, 0.83, 0.96, 1.22, 1.61]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Its own financial report for June 2025, on housing and small-business loans together, says.", "t0": 7.38, "t1": 13.54, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "The City’s own accounts", "source": "s1", "text": "Of a $3.48 billion loan portfolio, $3.16 billion is not expected to be collected.", "mark": "not expected to be collected"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.3, 0.55, 1.02, 1.39, 1.55, 1.83, 2.13, 3.37, 3.6, 4.07, 4.23, 4.93, 5.25, 5.66]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Of a 3.48 billion dollar loan portfolio, how much is not expected to be collected?", "t0": 13.66, "t1": 19.87, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "The City’s own accounts", "source": "s1", "text": "Of a $3.48 billion loan portfolio, $3.16 billion is not expected to be collected.", "mark": "not expected to be collected"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.27, 0.55, 0.82, 1.02, 1.24, 1.57, 1.85, 2.08, 3.16, 3.36, 3.57, 3.7, 3.86, 4.34, 4.45, 4.57]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "suspicious[0].what"], "text": "3.16 billion dollars.", "t0": 19.87, "t1": 21.78, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3.16 billion", "label": "not expected to be collected", "sub": "91% of the portfolio, June 2025"}, "emph": ["3.16"], "wt": [0.04, 0.32, 0.59, 0.81, 1.09, 1.41]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "sources"], "text": "That’s an official figure, in the City’s audited report from the Controller.", "t0": 22.3, "t1": 26.21, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "An official record", "sub": "San Francisco Controller: Annual Comprehensive Financial Report"}, "emph": ["official"], "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.38, 0.78, 1.52, 1.69, 1.81, 2.19, 2.67, 3.09, 3.27, 3.38]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[0]", "sources"], "text": "Ten years earlier, it was 93 percent.", "t0": 26.33, "t1": 28.5, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "An official record", "sub": "San Francisco Controller: Annual Comprehensive Financial Report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.5, 0.9, 0.99, 1.14, 1.65]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Why? By policy, the report says, many may be forgiven or extended, if their terms are met.", "t0": 28.72, "t1": 34.33, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "many of these loans may be forgiven or renegotiated and extended long into the future if certain terms and conditions of the loans are met"}, "emph": ["by policy"], "wt": [0.0, 0.85, 1.08, 1.59, 1.71, 2.06, 2.51, 2.82, 3.0, 3.14, 3.59, 3.77, 4.35, 4.53, 4.74, 5.04, 5.18]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["innocent[0]", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "They’re repaid only from a project’s money left over.", "t0": 34.45, "t1": 36.92, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City", "sub": "lends"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "The project", "sub": "pays only from money left over"}, {"art": "money", "name": "In the books", "sub": "mostly a grant"}], "kicker": "How the loans work"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.62, 0.85, 1.03, 1.11, 1.61, 1.86, 2.12]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["innocent[0]", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "So in the City’s own books, a loan is mostly a grant.", "t0": 37.04, "t1": 39.9, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City", "sub": "lends"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "The project", "sub": "pays only from money left over"}, {"art": "money", "name": "In the books", "sub": "mostly a grant"}], "kicker": "How the loans work"}, "emph": ["mostly a grant"], "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.33, 0.43, 0.74, 0.91, 1.42, 1.58, 1.85, 1.98, 2.34, 2.41]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "From 2019 to 2026, the housing offices lent 2.68 billion dollars.", "t0": 40.02, "t1": 46.24, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["lent, fiscal 2019 to 2026", "$2.68 billion"], "b": ["principal taken back", "$176.9 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.55, 1.01, 1.14, 1.43, 2.5, 2.66, 3.06, 3.56, 3.79, 4.07, 4.37, 4.75, 5.06, 5.47]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "They took back 176.9 million of principal.", "t0": 46.36, "t1": 49.92, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["lent, fiscal 2019 to 2026", "$2.68 billion"], "b": ["principal taken back", "$176.9 million"]}, "emph": ["176.9 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.38, 0.68, 0.91, 1.36, 2.08, 2.37, 2.65, 2.98, 3.08]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "About 7 cents for each dollar lent.", "t0": 50.04, "t1": 52.16, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "7 cents", "label": "of principal back, for each dollar lent"}, "emph": ["7 cents"], "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.67, 0.93, 1.06, 1.25, 1.56]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Who borrows? Each building has its own partnership.", "t0": 52.78, "t1": 55.87, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Mercy Housing California", "kicker": "The largest borrower", "sub": "through 21 partnerships", "chip": "$351.5 million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 1.44, 1.69, 2.01, 2.17, 2.31, 2.49]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Group them by owner, and the largest is Mercy Housing California: 351.5 million dollars.", "t0": 55.99, "t1": 62.47, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Mercy Housing California", "kicker": "The largest borrower", "sub": "through 21 partnerships", "chip": "$351.5 million"}, "emph": ["351.5 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.44, 0.61, 1.25, 1.46, 1.59, 2.01, 2.17, 2.49, 2.83, 4.0, 4.29, 4.58, 5.13, 5.41, 5.66, 5.99]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "Then Bridge Housing, the Mission Economic Development Agency, and Chinatown Community Development Center.", "t0": 62.59, "t1": 68.5, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Housing loans paid out, fiscal 2019 to 2027, by owner ($ million)", "rows": [["Mercy Housing California", "351.5"], ["Bridge Housing Corp", "250.8"], ["Mission Economic Development Agency", "170.4"], ["Chinatown Community Development Center", "99.5"], ["1064 Mission LP", "75.1"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.6, 1.55, 1.71, 2.04, 2.5, 2.96, 3.89, 4.09, 4.69, 5.13, 5.59]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "The top five got 36 percent.", "t0": 68.62, "t1": 70.37, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Housing loans paid out, fiscal 2019 to 2027, by owner ($ million)", "rows": [["Mercy Housing California", "351.5"], ["Bridge Housing Corp", "250.8"], ["Mission Economic Development Agency", "170.4"], ["Chinatown Community Development Center", "99.5"], ["1064 Mission LP", "75.1"]]}, "emph": ["36 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.4, 0.68, 0.88, 1.39]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "suspicious[2].what", "established[1]"], "text": "Now the Board’s own loan files. Since 2015, 41 of 80 change an earlier loan.", "t0": 70.59, "t1": 75.88, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "41", "label": "of 80 Board loan files change an earlier loan", "sub": "since 2015; 34 amend and restate it"}, "emph": ["41 of 80"], "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.37, 0.71, 0.95, 1.21, 1.96, 2.26, 2.56, 3.32, 3.79, 3.91, 4.2, 4.5, 4.61, 4.97]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "And how long is a typical loan?", "t0": 76.0, "t1": 77.89, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "The loan term", "kicker": "How long?", "sub": "25 files state it"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.32, 0.55, 0.67, 0.75, 1.14]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "57 years.", "t0": 77.89, "t1": 79.02, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "57 years", "label": "the typical loan term"}, "emph": ["57"], "wt": [0.04, 0.71]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "No Board file forgives a loan by name. And none records a repayment.", "t0": 79.54, "t1": 83.31, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["A file that forgives a loan by name", "A file that records a repayment"]}, "emph": ["none"], "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.53, 0.85, 1.21, 1.28, 1.48, 1.66, 2.27, 2.5, 2.74, 3.11, 3.18]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "suspicious[3].what"], "text": "Take Hunters View, Phase 1.", "t0": 83.53, "t1": 84.9, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Hunters View (Phase 1)", "kicker": "17 loans, one project", "sub": "2007 to 2013", "chip": "$42.7 million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.57, 0.77, 1.11]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "suspicious[3].what"], "text": "From 2007 to 2013, it got 17 loans,", "t0": 85.02, "t1": 89.83, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Hunters View (Phase 1)", "kicker": "17 loans, one project", "sub": "2007 to 2013", "chip": "$42.7 million"}, "emph": ["17 loans"], "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.42, 0.83, 1.32, 1.51, 1.82, 2.88, 3.03, 3.27, 3.79]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "suspicious[3].what"], "text": "42.7 million dollars.", "t0": 89.83, "t1": 92.26, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Hunters View (Phase 1)", "kicker": "17 loans, one project", "sub": "2007 to 2013", "chip": "$42.7 million"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.73, 1.05, 1.38, 1.72]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "suspicious[3].what"], "text": "Was any of it repaid? The only published loan table can’t say.", "t0": 92.38, "t1": 95.75, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "The only published loan table", "source": "s16", "text": "Fields: project id, project name, loan id, funding agreement date, amount of loan commitment. No borrower, balance, rate, term or repayment. It stops in 2015.", "mark": "No borrower, balance, rate, term or repayment"}, "emph": ["can’t say"], "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.41, 0.5, 0.62, 1.36, 1.53, 1.77, 2.14, 2.35, 2.64, 2.92]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "suspicious[3].what"], "text": "It has no borrower, balance or repayment, and it stops in 2015.", "t0": 95.87, "t1": 100.25, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "The only published loan table", "source": "s16", "text": "Fields: project id, project name, loan id, funding agreement date, amount of loan commitment. No borrower, balance, rate, term or repayment. It stops in 2015.", "mark": "No borrower, balance, rate, term or repayment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.37, 0.55, 1.24, 1.71, 1.85, 2.66, 2.86, 2.98, 3.38, 3.51, 3.82]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The records don’t show what any borrower owes. Or that any loan was forgiven improperly.", "t0": 100.47, "t1": 105.49, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["What any one borrower owes or has repaid", "That any loan was forgiven improperly"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.5, 0.73, 0.95, 1.12, 1.34, 1.83, 2.92, 3.16, 3.34, 3.56, 3.82, 3.97, 4.37]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "What would settle it? A loan-by-loan ledger: what was lent, what came back, what is owed.", "t0": 105.61, "t1": 111.46, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The housing office’s loan-by-loan ledger: borrower, balance, payments received"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.35, 0.65, 1.34, 1.5, 2.18, 3.07, 3.28, 3.48, 4.06, 4.3, 4.56, 4.91, 5.14, 5.29]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "story[5]"], "text": "The housing these loans pay for exists. What’s missing is a public ledger.", "t0": 111.58, "t1": 115.64, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.48, 0.67, 0.95, 1.17, 1.33, 2.36, 2.68, 3.11, 3.26, 3.34, 3.71]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 115.76, "t1": 118.13, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "lead1": "7 cents on the dollar", "lead2": "Who borrows", "lead3": "57-year loans", "lead4": "No public ledger", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "question"}